==Latin==

===Etymology===
From ''[[pro#Latin|pro]]'' (meaning "[[for]]") + the ablative singular of ''[[forma#Latin|forma]]'' (meaning "[[form]]" or "[[figure]]"). Literally meaning "for [[form]]" or "for the sake of form".

